  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9877.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este domingo, 4 de mayo, han finalizado las fiestas del barrio de la Morer&iacute;a de Onda con una comida multitudinaria en la que han podido disfrutar de un plato de alguna de las cuatro paellas que se han cocinado en la soleada parte ancha de la calle Recinto.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9859.jpg\" alt=\"img_9859\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9860.jpg\" alt=\"img_9860\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9861.jpg\" alt=\"img_9861\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9862.jpg\" alt=\"img_9862\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9863.jpg\" alt=\"img_9863\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9864.jpg\" alt=\"img_9864\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9865.jpg\" alt=\"img_9865\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellaultimdiumengemoreria14/img_9866.jpg\" alt=\"img_9866\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pael